    85	# direct set and dropped the dependency graph (codex §9 round 1, fix-1
    86	# finding 3). Verified lockfile-only at cbb56212; see design §5.5 for the
    87	# drift note (a future direct adoption of one of these is a legitimate reason
    88	# for it to leave this set, and the assertion only needs ONE survivor).
