   137	"""AC-SBOM-14 .. AC-SBOM-17 — the published-version seam.
   138	
   139	REQ-9 (injectable registry), REQ-10 (honest degradation).
   140	Design: dev/design/0.8.20-slice-31-sbom-survey-tool.md §5.4.
   141	
   142	A false "up-to-date" is the single worst output this tool can produce: it would
   143	let a live advisory be closed as `CLOSE-satisfied` in the LIBRARY-BUMP-STEWARD
   144	§2 triage. AC-SBOM-15 and AC-SBOM-16 are the two named guards against it.
   145	"""
   146	
   147	from __future__ import annotations
   148	
   149	import socket
   150	
   151	import pytest
   152	
   153	from conftest import REPO_ROOT, require
