   192	        " DIRECTIONS (every dependsOn ref resolves to a declared component"
   193	        " bom-ref, and every declared component appears as a `ref` entry), must"
   194	        " contain at least one library->library edge, and every component must"
   195	        " carry `fathomdb:depth` in {direct, transitive} with at least one"
   196	        " lockfile-only package tagged `transitive`.",
