    34	```
    35	
    36	Expected at Slice 31: **`23 failed, 0 passed, 0 skipped, 0 errors`** (exit code `1`).
    37	
    38	- **No test may skip and no test may pass** before Slice 32. A skip is a vacuous green.
    39	- **No module-level `import sbom_survey`.** The import happens inside each test body via the
    40	  `require()` helper in `tests/conftest.py`, so a missing package produces 23 attributable FAILEDs
    41	  rather than one collection error that hides 22 of them.
    42	- The suite needs **no network**. The published-version lookup is behind an injectable seam; the
    43	  tests inject `OfflineSource` / `StaticSource`, and one test asserts zero socket I/O.
    44	- **`AC-SBOM-10` grades CycloneDX validity with an INDEPENDENT validator** — the upstream
