    80	## Scope guard
    81	
    82	The tool **never** applies a dependency bump and **never** edits a manifest or a lockfile. Its only
    83	write path is its own gitignored output directory. The survey is an **input to 0.8.22**, which owns
    84	the actual upgrades.
