   775	## 7. Why landing the RED suite turns no existing gate red
   776	
   777	**Load-bearing for the land — re-verified at `cbb56212` in this worktree.**
   778	
   779	| Gate | Scope | `scripts/sbom-survey/**` in scope? |
   780	|---|---|---|
   781	| `scripts/agent-test.sh` shell tests | **explicit one-by-one registration** of `scripts/tests/test_*.sh` (25 `run_capped` lines); no glob | **no** — different directory, and this slice registers nothing |
   782	| `scripts/agent-test.sh` pytest legs | exactly two: `pytest -q src/python/tests` and `pytest -q dev/agent-tools/ledgerwatch` | **no** |
   783	| `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | invokes named scripts (`agent-verify.sh`, `lint-*.sh`, `scripts/tests/test_*.sh`); no pytest glob | **no** |
   784	| `scripts/agent-lint.sh` ruff | `ruff check src/python` | **no** |
   785	| `scripts/agent-typecheck.sh` pyright | `pyright -p src/python` | **no** |
   786	| `scripts/check.sh` | `python3 -m compileall src/python/fathomdb src/python/tests` | **no** |
   787	| `scripts/agent-security.sh` ast-scan | `ast_scan.py` python root is `src/python` | **no** |
   788	| `scripts/tests/test_smoke_scripts.sh` | `scripts/release/smoke/` only | **no** |
   789	| `markdownlint-cli2` | globs `**/*.md` | **YES** — `README.md` and this design doc are linted; both pass (§8) |
   790	| `lychee` (offline) | `**/*.md` | **YES** — no broken local links introduced |
   791	| `scripts/lint-design-status.sh` | `dev/design/**/*.md` recursive | **YES** — this doc carries `status: ACTIVE` |
   792	
   793	**Pytest configuration — TC-97.** The only pytest config in the repository is
   794	`src/python/pyproject.toml`, whose `[tool.pytest.ini_options]` sets `pythonpath = ["."]` (which
   795	shadows an installed wheel). pytest resolves `rootdir`/`configfile` by walking **upwards from the
   796	test arguments**; `scripts/sbom-survey/tests` has no `pyproject.toml`, `pytest.ini`, `tox.ini` or
   797	`setup.cfg` on any ancestor path, and `src/python/pyproject.toml` is not an ancestor. The suite is
   798	therefore run with **no config file** and cannot inherit that `pythonpath`. Verified in §8 (the
   799	pytest header prints `configfile:` only when one was found).
   800	
   801	**Nothing is wired anywhere.** No CI job, no `agent-test.sh` line, no `agent-verify.sh` leg. That is
   802	deliberate (§3a: *recurring by design, NOT CI-gating*) and doubly necessary here, because the suite
   803	is RED by construction until Slice 32 lands — wiring it would turn `main` red.
